  "instructions": [
    "heat a raclette grill to medium-high heat.",
    "slice the flour tortillas into slider-sized pieces.",
    "brush the tortillas with a little bit of oil and season with salt, black pepper, turmeric powder, and garam masala.",
    "place the norwegian fish sticks on the grill and cook for 2-3 minutes per side, or until golden brown and cooked through.",
    "while the fish sticks are cooking, mix together the ricotta cheese, slivered almonds, and pickled ginger in a bowl.",
    "add a spoonful of the cheese mixture onto each tortilla, followed by a cooked fish stick.",
    "drizzle the ginger cordial and lemon juice over the top of each slider.",
    "garnish with fresh parsley and serve immediately."
  ],
